"""Toolchain configuration and version errors that reproduce offline in pinned images.

Every failing command was run in its image before it was written here. The fixes change configuration or tooling
(PATH, go.mod, rust-toolchain.toml, Cargo.toml edition, a classpath, a release flag, a jar manifest, a settings file),
never application code.
"""

